# UI

- Tailwind utilities; colors via CSS vars in `src/index.css` (e.g. `var(--accent)`).
- Prefer shared components from `@/components/ui`: `Card`, `KpiCard`, `Badge`, `ProgressBar`, `PageHeader`, `EmptyState`, `LoadingBlock`.
- Conditional classes: `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Stage/status labels and formatters live in `@/lib/utils` — do not duplicate across pages.
- Keep the existing dark admin look and Chinese copy.
